  "notes": "{暗記|あんき} means memorization, typically through repetition.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{暗記|あんき}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {暗記|あんき}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to memorize)\n- {暗記|あんき}⟦できる→できる：00557_dekiru⟧ (can memorize)\n- {丸|まる}{暗記|あんき} (rote memorization)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{記憶|きおく}→記憶：00234_kioku⟧: memory (the faculty or stored information)\n- {暗記|あんき}: memorization (the act of memorizing)\n- ⟦{暗唱|あんしょう}→暗唱：14801_anshou⟧: recitation from memory",
